# Only requirements.txt, app/ and data/horizon/ are copied into the image; keep local artefacts out of the
# build context so builds are reproducible and nothing private or platform-specific leaks into a layer.
*
!requirements.txt
!app/
!data/horizon/
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.env
**/.env.*
# Local scientific data (the kernels a developer downloaded, LOLA DEMs): the image gets its kernels from
# NAIF with pinned checksums instead (Dockerfile), never from a developer's disk.
app/physics/data/
